{"about_the_game":"<strong>Sword Tomb-Kan Yu</strong> is a fast-paced 2D action-platformer packed with roguelike elements, Metroidvania elements and subspace exploration.<br><br>As the inheritor of an ancient sect, he follows the wishes of his ancestors and enters the sword tomb alone to fight against the depraved subspace creatures and the cyborg humans compelled by them. As the search continues for the powerful weapons and skills secret left behind by the ancestors, the clues to the destruction of the sect will also become clearer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640150/extras/517167e6cf05223cb45069424a7707ad.poster.avif?t=1710382377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640150/extras/517167e6cf05223cb45069424a7707ad.webm?t=1710382377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640150/extras/517167e6cf05223cb45069424a7707ad.mp4?t=1710382377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2>~The main character can skillfully use multiple flying swords, each of them can be controlled individually. Brisk melee combos, cool sword control stunts, free combination, meet the needs of all kinds of players.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640150/extras/336ae740db1e9f4f5d2656f4d8cd055b.poster.avif?t=1710382377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640150/extras/336ae740db1e9f4f5d2656f4d8cd055b.webm?t=1710382377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1640150/extras/336ae740db1e9f4f5d2656f4d8cd055b.mp4?t=171038237